heading": "Gpu Ci Credential Rotation And Image Promotion Safety", "snippet": "- Revert registry image tag on affected warm pools to previous production tag via terraform apply -var=\'image_tag=${PREV_TAG}\' - Recreate node groups (if nodes are stuck) by triggering warm-pool rolling-replace job. 4) Post-incident: open an incident review, attach promotion ledger entries, CI logs, KMS audit trail, and the short-lived session token logs. Observability and SLOs to enforce - Canary latency delta SLO: canary 99th must stay within +25% of baseline during canary window. - Image pull success: >=99.5% successful pulls within 1m of request at steady state. - Promotion lead time: preflight checks must finish within 90 minutes for standard releases; emergencies may use expedited path with manual approve\xe2\x80\xa6", "score": 0.4445, "source_id": "b17fa25ce7d34acab77e3ad6267b5159", "source_name": "Project b3086c26ae3c45b6b8710f3c"}], "answer_status": "answered", "no_answer_reason": null, "exploration_id": null, "stats": {"canonical_index": true, "ready_versions": 81, "requested_top_k": null, "candidate_top_k": 64, "candidate_unit_pool_limit": 1024, "candidate_pool_saturated": true, "candidate_units_before_cap": 120, "candidate_units_after_cap": 120, "candidate_units_truncated": 0, "semantic_candidates": 64, "lexical_candidates": 64, "candidates": 120, "relevant": 66, "filtered_irrelevant": 54, "fusion_method": "rrf", "selection_method": "authorized_content_dedup_mmr", "cross_scope_merge": "rank_interleave", "coverage": {"candidate_count": 128, "deduplicated_count": 0, "diversity_weight": 0.5, "near_duplicate_similarity": 0.98, "required_anchor_count": 0, "covered_anchor_count": 0, "anchor_coverage": "not_required", "status": "unknown", "canonical_locator_verified": true, "semantic_answerability": "unknown"}, "routing": {"planner": {"planner_version": "qsp-v1", "requested_strategy": "AUTO", "effective_strategy": "ENTITY_RELATIONAL", "modifiers": [], "reason_codes": ["RELATION_CUE